# Secrets. Never commit. Holds GEMINI_API_KEY.
# `*.env` is needed as well as `.env`: the first two patterns miss `secrets.env`,
# which is exactly the gap test_no_secrets_committed.py caught.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
